				// and 0.012 deep (2026-10-23). These fallback rates are used only when Exa's
				// response omits `costDollars`. Brave's LLM Context endpoint is part of the
				// same Search plan ($5/1,000 requests), so the Brave rate is unchanged.
				"NUXT_PUBLIC_BRAVE_SEARCH_COST_PER_THOUSAND_REQUESTS_USD": "5",
